# Request bodies. httpbun echoes form fields and files back.

### Urlencoded form with an @ in a value
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=parcels@example.com&name=Ann+Lee&city=Ume%C3%A5

### Whole body from a file
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: application/json

< ./files/shipment.json

### Body from a file with its variables filled in
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: application/json

<@ ./files/template.json

### Multipart with a text field and a file
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ParcelBoundary

--ParcelBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

A parcel label
--ParcelBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="label"; filename="label.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./files/label.txt
--ParcelBoundary--

### XML
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: application/xml

<shipment reference="ORDER-20871">
  <carrier>postnord</carrier>
</shipment>

### Plain text, comment lines in a body are sent as they are
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: text/plain

# This line is part of the body
Parcel picked up at 14:05
